+ * LG R66456 ordinary SDR Auto restore. Derived from the actual LG mappers
+ * at 2e897dddf49a4c3e85b2ff77fdf7c70f860398dd and each profile's DTS.
+ * Policy: screen_mode=Auto, HDR=off, RGB preset=2, offsets=0, sharpness=off.
+ * This is an explicit current XNU policy, not Android userspace state.
+ * Color and sharpness each keep their bank-select/restore packets; only
+ * PV waits 20ms after CE. Six HS packets total, one physical DMA packet.
+ * See test-mh2lm-lineage-color-reference.py and PANEL-LINEAGE-COLOR.md.
+ */
